      "title": "action-task-B — ConfirmSpec + generic gate + [confirm] config",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "ConfirmSpec/ResponseButton/Outcome/ButtonRole/ConfirmCallback (pure data + native Callback). 3 destructive actions declared as specs. Central gate maybe_confirm_destructive reads the catalog spec, raises open_confirm which converts ConfirmSpec→ModalSpec and runs the chosen button's Outcome via run_outcome (Proceed=registry.execute gate-bypass no loop, Cancel, Dispatch=dispatch_action, Callback=native closure). B2: generic [confirm] table (heca-config::confirm::ConfirmConfig, HashMap<String,bool>) on Config.confirm replacing the three [settings] confirm_* fields; AppState.confirm + confirm_enabled(); config.default.toml [confirm] (delete_pane/delete_column/delete_workspace=true).",
