      "shortName": "action-task-a",
      "title": "action-task-A — Runtime registry foundation",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "ActionCatalog (heca/src/actions.rs) — runtime metadata store seeded from built-in ActionRegistry::ALL descriptors on AppState.action_catalog. Migrate every metadata lookup off the ActionRegistry::{find,icon,label} statics (removed) to the catalog: mouse.rs context-menu builders, InputMode::pending_pick + render::status_mode_parts, chrome helpers pane_action_spec/sidebar_toggle_button. by_category/count/category/default_binding kept for command-palette/RPC introspection.",
